# ==============================================================================
# FINN - AI Investment Agent Task Configuration
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Google Gemini API Key (Free tier key from https://aistudio.google.com/)
GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here

# 2. Granular Task-Specific Model Settings

# MODEL_PULL_RESEARCH:
# Triggered when an investor queries any NSE stock (portfolio or ad-hoc ticker) in "Pull Research".
# Task: Performs first-principles company breakdown directly from primary filings.
# It extracts:
#  - The 3 Core Value Drivers (what pivotal operating levers move earnings)
#  - Upstream Supply-Chain Backtracking (input commodities, budget outlays, and tariffs)
#  - Player Intent (Management incentives vs Institutional FII/DII positioning vs Valuation friction)
#  - Fact-grounded Bull vs Bear structural case
MODEL_PULL_RESEARCH=gemini-3.5-flash-lite

# MODEL_NARRATIVE_AUDIT:
# Triggered in the "Promise vs Reality" module of Pull Research (The challenge's highlight feature).
# Task: Audits management's past earnings-call (concall) guidance vs subsequent audited numbers.
# It checks:
#  - What management promised in previous quarters (growth, margin bands, capex plans)
#  - What actual audited quarterly results delivered (beat, miss, margin compression)
#  - Issues a clear verdict: "Delivered", "Lagging on Margin", "Missed Target", or "Over-Delivered"
#  - Free Cash Flow quality check: whether accounting profits turned into real cash
MODEL_NARRATIVE_AUDIT=gemini-3.5-flash-lite

# MODEL_FILINGS_TRIAGE:
# Triggered in "Push Digest" when monitoring the incoming exchange announcements stream.
# Task: High-speed classification and noise-filtering across the portfolio.
# It separates:
#  - High-impact material items: Quarterly results, M&A/demergers, large capex, litigation
#  - Collapsed routine paperwork: ESOPs, compliance certificates, newspaper ads, AGM notices
# It assigns priority badges ("High", "Medium", "Low") and generates 1-line plain-English summaries
MODEL_FILINGS_TRIAGE=gemini-3.5-flash-lite

# MODEL_EXEC_ENRICHMENT:
# Triggered in "Push Digest" when a leadership change filing drops (e.g., CEO, CFO, CTO change).
# Task: Synthesizes professional pedigree and strategic context instead of raw "person resigned".
# It extracts:
#  - Incoming executive's previous company and leadership pedigree (e.g. from LinkedIn/filings)
#  - Track record and technical/operating credentials
#  - Strategic signal: why this specific appointment matters for the company's future
MODEL_EXEC_ENRICHMENT=gemini-3.5-flash-lite

# MODEL_FALLBACK:
# Graceful safety net model if a cutting-edge preview model is temporarily unavailable in your region.
MODEL_FALLBACK=gemini-2.5-flash-lite

# 3. Server Port
PORT=3001
